WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.540
A visitor walks in.

2
00:00:01.590 --> 00:00:05.800
He jumps up and hugs her, as
if he hasn't seen her in years.

3
00:00:05.850 --> 00:00:07.620
She was here an hour ago.

4
00:00:07.670 --> 00:00:09.160
And yesterday.

5
00:00:09.210 --> 00:00:12.260
Then he sits at the piano
and plays a long piece,

6
00:00:12.310 --> 00:00:14.200
every note in place.

7
00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:17.010
So how can he lose a whole
visit within minutes,

8
00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:20.460
yet still play a complicated
piece from memory?

9
00:00:20.510 --> 00:00:23.520
In this mission, you'll
meet two kinds of amnesia:

10
00:00:23.570 --> 00:00:25.630
losing memories from before brain damage,

11
00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:28.910
and being unable to
form new ones after it.

12
00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:32.020
Then you'll see the everyday
problems each type causes,

13
00:00:32.070 --> 00:00:35.140
and find out which
explanation really fits him.

14
00:00:35.190 --> 00:00:39.470
Your mission: explain how he can
forget a visitor but still play.
